{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/70f7a9261296c9d4bfb61fffb33d6788.poster.avif?t=1757853337\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/70f7a9261296c9d4bfb61fffb33d6788.webm?t=1757853337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/70f7a9261296c9d4bfb61fffb33d6788.mp4?t=1757853337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why SuperWEIRD?</h2>We're the studio behind while True: learn(), Craftomation 101, and Learning Factory, and we're making our next game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/be5fd35a9a428ee9da84399607a9541c.poster.avif?t=1757853337\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/be5fd35a9a428ee9da84399607a9541c.webm?t=1757853337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/be5fd35a9a428ee9da84399607a9541c.mp4?t=1757853337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's a co-op automation adventure in a place where things are... well, weird. Robots are acting strange, the locals are distressed, and what the hell is living in the woods? It's okay though: just fix and automate everything and you'll get outta here, maybe!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to SuperWEIRD?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use flags to mark paths for an endless stream of mindless robots<br></li><li>Make them harvest resources and craft stuff for you<br></li><li>Arm your robots, or even better: make robots arm other robots<br></li><li>Build and optimize huge and complex systems of robots<br></li><li>Play with friends in co-op mode to make things better\u2026 or much worse<br></li><li>Nevermind the pig in shades... for now</li></ul><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818770?t=1757853337","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/8809f638809ce6bc3de01d95840ad822e9c63d72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757853337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/b6d073f08f64abac83f052e07f598780d6847b7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757853337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/b6d073f08f64abac83f052e07f598780d6847b7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757853337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/70f7a9261296c9d4bfb61fffb33d6788.poster.avif?t=1757853337\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/70f7a9261296c9d4bfb61fffb33d6788.webm?t=1757853337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/70f7a9261296c9d4bfb61fffb33d6788.mp4?t=1757853337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why SuperWEIRD?</h2>We're the studio behind while True: learn(), Craftomation 101, and Learning Factory, and we're making our next game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic